# Model weights are committed directly to the repository — NOT via Git LFS.
#
# History: these files were tracked by Git LFS until 2026-10-04. The account's
# LFS budget was exceeded, so *every* clone received 132-byte pointer files
# instead of weights. Consequences: the plugin failed to load (mamba_init()
# returns false when weights are unreadable) and test_mamba3 aborted with
# std::bad_alloc while parsing a pointer file as a weight header.
#
# The model is small (6.6 MB), so plain Git is the right storage. Keep these
# files binary: never apply line-ending conversion.
models/*.bin -text -diff
